# ============================================================
# Integrated Medicine & Blood Management — environment template
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values. NEVER commit `.env`.
# Target database: MySQL 8.0+ (MariaDB is NOT supported).
# ============================================================

# --- MySQL connection used by the running application ---
